WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:09.823
Chitsanzo choyamba chikusonyeza kuyankha kwabwino kwa mwana wa diso lowunikiridwa.

00:00:09.823 --> 00:00:19.647
Yang'anani mmene mwana wa diso akusinthira kuwala kukalunjikitsidwa m'diso.

00:00:19.647 --> 00:00:29.470
Pa chitsanzo chomaliza, mawu akuti mwana wa diso sakuyankha kuwala.
